          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosia omorwoti bw’Abayuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Amg 34:1)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosia nigo arenge nemiaka etano na etato, ekero achagete kogamba, na akagaamba emiaka emerongo etato nomo agwo Yerusalemu. Ng’ina nigo arenge korokwa Yedida, mosubati bw’Adaya korwa Bosikati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosia agakora ayare amaronge ase amaiso ’Omonene, akabwatia chinchera chionsi chia Daudi sokoro yaye; taonchogete gochia aande onsi, ensemo y’okorio gose ey’okobee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Egetabu ki’Amachiko ekonyorekana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Amg 34:8-28)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka o ikomi na gatano ase okogaamba kwa Yosia omorwoti agatoma Safani omoriki, mosinto bw’Asalia o Mesulamu, ase enyomba y’Omonene, agateeba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Genda ase Hilikia, Omokuani bw’omonene, omoboorie abare chitaabu chiarentirwe ase enyomba y’Omonene, echio abarendi b’egesieri basangereirie korwa ase abanto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chibesa echi chiegwe abateneneri b’emeremo egokorwa ase enyomba y’Omonene, na barabwo bachiee abakori emeremo b’enyomba eyio, baria bakoyeroisia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na abasenia be chibao, na abaagachi, na abaagachi b’amagena. Naende chitaabu chiria chigorwe chibao, na amagena abaachire ase okoagachera enyomba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende timobaboria borokie omobaro bwe chitaabu chirabekwe ase amaboko abo, ekiagera nigo barachikorere emeremo ase obwegenwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hilikia, Omokuani bw’omonene, agateebia Safani omoriki, “Nanyorire egetabu y’Amachiko ase enyomba y’Omonene.” Hilikia akaa Safani egetabu eria, nere akayesoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio omoriki oria akagenda ase omorwoti, akamoteebia, “Abasomba bao mbarusia chitaabu chionsi chianyorekana ase enyomba, bakaa abakori emeremo abwo bare abateneneri b’emeremo egokorwa ase enyomba y’Omonene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Safani agateebia omorwoti: “Hilikia Omokuani nang’a egetabu.” Erio Safani agasomera omorwoti egetabu eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ekero omorwoti aigwete amang’ana y’Egetabu keria ki’Amachiko agatandora chianga chiaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio agachiika Hilikia Omokuani, na Ahikamu, mosinto o Safani, na Akibori, mosinto o Mikaya, na Safani omoriki, na Asaia, omokoreri bw’omorwoti, akabateebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Genda moboorie momanye korwa ase Omonene igoro yane, na igoro y’abanto baito, na igoro y’Abayuda bonsi, tomanye amang’ana are ase egetabu eke yanyorekanire. Endamwamu y’Omonene yokire ase tore, ekiagera chisokoro chiaito tichiaigwerete amang’ana y’egetabu eke, na tichiakorete aya onsi ariikire ase engencho yaito.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo Hilikia Omokuani, na Ahikamu, na Akibori, na Safani, na Asaia bakagenda koboria Hulda, omobani omokungu, mokaa Salumu, mosinto o Tikiwa, o Harasi. Salumu oyio nigo arenge omorendi bwe rigachero rie chianga. Ase ekero ekio Hulda nigo amenyete agwo Yerusalemu ase ensemo enyia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokungu oria akabateebia, “Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, nigo agoteeba ng’a mogende ase omonto oria obatomete gocha ase ’nde, momoteebie:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nar’Omonene agoteeba: Rora inche Omonene nindete igoro y’aase aiga, na igoro y’abanto b’aiga, amabe aya onsi ariikire ase egetabu eke omorwoti bw’Abayuda asomire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo bantigire inche na basambire ubani ase chinyasae ching’ao, na bangechirie goika nabeire nendamwamu ase engencho y’emeremo yonsi bakorire namaboko abo. Ase ayio, endamwamu yane nayoke igoro y’aase aiga, tegokendigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ase omorwoti bw’Abayuda, oria obatoma erinde amanye korwa ase ’nde inche Omonene, aya naro moramoteebie: Aya nar’Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba igoro y’amang’ana ayakwaigwete:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero kwaigwa amang’ana aria, naye ogekanya, okaba omoitongo ase obosio bwane inche Omonene. Na ekero kwaigwete buna nakwanete igoro y’aase aiga, na igoro y’abanto b’aiga ng’a goika basirigwe na babe okoragererigwa, aye ogatandora chianga chiao, naende okarera ase obosio bwane. Naboigo inche Omonene nkogoteebia ng’a nakoigure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, ningosangererie ase chisokoro chiao chiachiete; aye nobekwe ase embeera yao kore nomorembe, na amaiso ao takorora obobe boria bwonsi ndarente igoro y’aase aiga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Barabwo bakairera omorwoti amang’ana ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
